      <description>&lt;p&gt;I really can&amp;#39;t decide. I want my blog to be less associated with my name, but also want to use a good name and domain. I always liked Brent Simmons&amp;#39; &amp;quot;inessential.com&amp;quot;. Which domain to use for my blog going forward? Would appreciate a comment why you picked your choice. &lt;a href="https://click.ba.it/tags/blog" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;blog&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://click.ba.it/tags/blogging" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;blogging&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;radio disabled="disabled"&gt;Continue to use jason.re&lt;/radio&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;radio disabled="disabled"&gt;undertow.blog&lt;/radio&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;radio disabled="disabled"&gt;staticvoid.blog&lt;/radio&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;radio disabled="disabled"&gt;monograph.cloud&lt;/radio&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
